  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.12 Post-closure care",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.12 “Post-closure care” means the inspection, monitoring, maintenance, and repair of a facility, or any part thereof, after closure.\n\nSource. #14103, eff 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
